  "body": "Our vendors are committed to achieving a sale and are calling for all serious offers to be presented.\r\n\r\nPositioned proudly on a spectacular cliff-top site with panoramic 180-degree views, including a remarkable aspect right down Milford Beach, this is a home that delivers an extraordinary coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Milford Beach, Milford Village, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities, the position combines absolute convenience with a wonderful sense of privacy and escape.\r\n\r\nOccupying the premier end position within an exclusive enclave of just four residences, the home enjoys a privileged forward aspect that maximises privacy, sunshine and arguably some of the finest coastal views available in Milford.\r\n\r\nA grand double-height foyer creates an immediate sense of arrival. The main living level has been thoughtfully designed around the spectacular outlook, with two generous living areas and an open-plan kitchen and dining space, all enjoying a strong connection to the water. Large arched windows frame the ever-changing seascape, while multiple entertaining areas flow effortlessly outdoors.\r\n\r\nThe sun-filled pool terrace, complete with sauna, provides a superb setting for family living and entertaining. Beyond, beautifully landscaped grounds lead to a lower viewing deck where the drama of this unique cliff-top position can be fully appreciated. Thanks to its forward placement relative to neighbouring properties, the home enjoys exceptional all-day sun throughout the year.\r\n\r\nThe upper level accommodates four generous double bedrooms and two bathrooms, including an ensuite. The two waterfront bedrooms are particularly special, opening directly onto a substantial rooftop deck where the elevated position captures breathtaking views across the Hauraki Gulf and islands beyond.\r\n\r\nIf you can’t reach Andrew Dorreen, please contact his Sales Associate, Anna Jones, on 021 489 171.",
